        "subject": "Update on your application - Marketing Associate at Nimbus Fitness",
        "message": "=Hi {{ $json.output.applicant_name }},<br><br>Thank you for taking the time to apply for the Marketing Associate role at Nimbus Fitness, and for sharing your background with us.<br><br>After reviewing your application, we've decided to move forward with other candidates whose experience more closely matches what we're looking for at this time.<br><br>This isn't a reflection of your abilities - hiring decisions often come down to a very specific fit for a specific role, and we know that's not always visible from the outside. We'd genuinely encourage you to keep an eye on future openings with us, as our needs evolve quickly.<br><br>Wishing you the best in your search.<br><br>Best,<br>The Nimbus Fitness Team",
